# Demo standards

## Theme tokens

Use constants from `src/lib/theme.ts` for page layout. Gallery thumb width and grid row unit live in `src/app/constants/galleryLayout.js`.

## Gallery layout

- Masonry grid: `grid gallery gap-1` with `GalleryImage` component.
- Match patterns from nextjs-image-gallery (`ImgContainer`, `GalleryInfiniteScroll`).

## API routes

Follow `src/app/api/reference/gallery/route.ts` and `src/lib/api/`:
- `withApiHandler` wrapper
- Zod via `parseQueryParams` / `parseJsonBody`
- Pexels fetch via `src/lib/gallery/fetchImages.ts`
- Blur placeholders via `addBlurredDataUrls`

## Feature ideas

Add demo cards in `src/lib/demoFeatureIdeas.ts` — gallery features, not meta Cursor UI.
